a map called m is {"status": "ok", "count": 3}.
a list called vs is m's values.

a value called sep is element 1 of vs.
print "separate: {sep}".

a value called ch is element 1 of m's values.
print "chained values: {ch}".

a value called ck is element 1 of m's keys.
print "chained keys: {ck}".

a number called ln is m's length.
print "length: {ln}".
